#: ../../source/templates_sentry.md:94
msgid "Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sentry.md:95
msgid ""
"**Dual personality**: Dammit Sans brings irreverent brand character at "
"display scale; Rubik provides clean professionalism for everything "
"functional."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sentry.md:96
msgid ""
"**Uppercase as system**: Buttons, captions, labels, and micro-text all "
"use `text-transform: uppercase` with subtle letter-spacing "
"(0.2px–0.25px), creating a systematic \"technical label\" pattern "
"throughout."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sentry.md:97
msgid ""
"**Weight stratification**: Rubik uses 400 (body), 500 (emphasis/nav), 600"
" (titles/strong), 700 (buttons/CTAs) — a clean four-tier weight system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sentry.md:98
msgid ""
"**Tight headings, relaxed body**: All headings use 1.10–1.25 line-height;"
" body uses 1.50; small captions expand to 2.00 for readability at tiny "
"sizes."
msgstr ""

