#: ../../source/templates_sentry.md:211
msgid ""
"**Shadow Philosophy**: Sentry uses a unique combination of inset shadows "
"(buttons feel pressed INTO the surface) and ambient glows (content "
"radiates from the dark background). The deep purple ambient shadow "
"(`rgba(22, 15, 36, 0.9)`) is the signature — it creates a bioluminescent "
"quality where content seems to emit its own purple-tinted light."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sentry.md:213
msgid "7. Do's and Don'ts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sentry.md:215
msgid "Do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sentry.md:216
msgid ""
"Use deep purple backgrounds (`#1f1633`, `#150f23`) — never pure black "
"(`#000000`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sentry.md:217
msgid "Apply inset shadows on primary buttons for the tactile pressed effect"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sentry.md:218
msgid "Use Dammit Sans ONLY for hero/display headings — Rubik for everything else"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sentry.md:219
msgid ""
"Apply `text-transform: uppercase` with `letter-spacing: 0.2px` on buttons"
" and labels"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sentry.md:220
msgid "Use the lime-green accent (`#c2ef4e`) sparingly for maximum impact"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sentry.md:221
msgid ""
"Employ frosted glass effects (`blur(18px) saturate(180%)`) for layered "
"surfaces"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sentry.md:222
msgid ""
"Maintain the warm purple shadow tones — shadows should feel purple-"
"tinted, not neutral gray"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sentry.md:223
msgid ""
"Use Rubik's 4-tier weight system: 400 (body), 500 (nav/emphasis), 600 "
"(titles), 700 (CTAs)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sentry.md:225
msgid "Don't"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sentry.md:226
msgid ""
"Don't use pure black (`#000000`) for backgrounds — always use the warm "
"purple-blacks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sentry.md:227
msgid "Don't apply Dammit Sans to body text or UI elements — it's display-only"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sentry.md:228
msgid ""
"Don't use standard gray (`#666`, `#999`) for borders — use purple-tinted "
"grays (`#362d59`, `#584674`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sentry.md:229
msgid "Don't drop the uppercase treatment on buttons — it's a system-wide pattern"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sentry.md:230
msgid ""
"Don't use sharp corners (0px radius) — minimum 6px for all interactive "
"elements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sentry.md:231
msgid ""
"Don't mix the lime-green accent with the coral/pink accents in the same "
"component"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sentry.md:232
msgid ""
"Don't use flat (non-inset) shadows on primary buttons — the tactile "
"quality is signature"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_sentry.md:233
msgid "Don't forget letter-spacing on uppercase text — 0.2px minimum"
msgstr ""

